<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthis have intensified attacks on Saudi Arabia, striking the Jazan refinery and killing a worker, disrupting operations, and hitting two Saudi ports on the Red Sea, while also targeting oil infrastructure and a financial district in Riyadh. Saudi forces intercepted drones and missiles over the Red Sea and western Yemen in response. Iran denied involvement in a reported drone attack that killed two Italians in Kuwait. The conflict caused 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxPdnRCOV9oVk5kcUpkQW5HOGFFMVNVdlFtRXpmVmV4bGNFX0pKdkE2SUpQdkFoRDFoSWJaZTl0Y3JJNks5MmU2S05fTkFBWmtGQm5neXljY210c0xmNXlsVnVwcEwzVGVnc3huTDVhQXZwODJzdjZZbFBZQS05N0F2c2drLWlaMXlqaVo3YVYxR1NCcTdNYjdNSHhIUHo1cUx1ZzhvVjRJRWszLUprcDNpQWZRTQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxORnNINWJlUzU0bDVSQ1Z5TWhtZTl1dzVxa01lbWhiMTg0bjBKZzQtbld6RmpIQ3NOSkctT29wTmdmR3VCcHpMbzdBQUdQSU0wVWItQU1COHhCS1BzYnpoOTJsRzl2TWp0aVNNZWVpZVFhS2cwWXVtNnA0bzRfUXNTRTJRTEVHem5BY2V2SURxZG9Vb3VkT3FNa1RuR3RfZWJQUE15WTdGaVFudnJaeVJIdVhXdE9PcWFuY2c?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxPaWM5bTBpVVdXcm1DeXd5eTFMWXRUWVFIalFzYnE5bGVqS3dVbldzMXFralFtOWdoaXZDS0NtbE83ME5ZS3cwZkdaRFJsTFlzcFlhQnhmbGF3a1hSdmVsUU9Dc1VLWXJmV2J2aTlETkhSWXd1dlNCamZOeEdlSnN6dXdCN3p5TUd5bDJsVlVpM0J6UVN3TzNEd2wyQ2ZpQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxQNUdlenhjamNKTzFaUG9EMVdzb0wwbmlNd1dYLU15Q2xDWDVuYVN6cWtrZlUyRTMxeGdKbVMzaXh0SXNRS1RGUUd1bnhIS3dtYXpLTi1BQkJjSm5SaUhWcENBTlRyZ2dlNEFnbUFOWkdxYlBYUC1sN2NUR0pDc2hDNjR3SF91ODVpOHRCUw?oc=5&quot;&gt;CNN&lt;/